#12901
An Antechamber~
   You can barely see in the dim candlelight of this antechamber, but you are
able to make out dark, arched passageways which lead in all directions except
south. Although this room appears to be very old, with walls made of rough-cut
stone, it lacks a sense of decay which tells you that this area must see
regular use. You shudder to think by what.
   There is a narrow opening directly above you, but you are unable to tell
where it leads in the darkness.
