#12902
A Dark Hallway~
   It is incredibly dark here, forcing you to provide light sources of your
own. The walls and floor here are rought-cut stone, which is cold to the
touch. You find yourself having to walk slowly to avoid tripping on any nooks
in the rock floor. At first, this hallway appears to be a mine tunnel of some
sort, but now you notice the lack of man-made structural support. Whatever
made this tunnel, carved it through solid rock. The passage turns north here,
and east returns you to a dim foyer.
