#12906
A Training Area~
   There is a large red mat made of out some type of heavy cloth spread out on
the ground here, and many weapons line the walls. You surmise that this area
is used by the tong to train their initiates in weapons use. Gazing at the
vast array of hand-to-hand weaponry, you realize that these are not merely
training weapons - these are the real thing!  Suddenly, you remember the cloth
mat beneath your feet. With horror, you suddenly realize that you now know why
it is colored red.
