#12912
An Intersection~
   This is a T-intersection in a labyrinth of cool, dark passageways. Tunnels
to the west, south, and east lead into darkness, while there is a heavy
iron-bound oak door to your north. The dampness in these passages has caused
the oak to swell in the door frame, leaving it cracked and blistered. It has
also managed to rust the iron bindings, the heavy iron knocker, and the iron
keyhole. Cool, still air hangs heavily around you.
