#12931
By A Surface Pool~
   This room is completely damp, dominated in its centre by a perfectly
circular surface pool. The pool glows slightly, you suspect because it has
been lit from underneath. The large amount of open water in this room has
caused significant moisture accumulation on the stone walls and floor, making
walking around quite a challenge. This pool must be how the Tong smuggle black
market goods into Kir-Oshi. It must lead out to the harbor somehow.
~
