#12932
By A Surface Pool~
   As you continue around this room, you notice that the floor is really
rather slick; you should watch your step so that you don't fall head first
int the pool. Looking into the pool, you notice that it is, indeed, lit from
the bottom by two caged light sources. It also appears to turn into an
underwater tunnel of sorts several feet below the surface. The Tong must have
some sort of device to transport black market goods under the water, and bring
them here. You notice several mechanical apparatus to your south, perhaps they
have something to do with the actual transportation of the goods?
~
