By A Surface Pool~
   There is a mechanical winch and metal chain coiled loosely on the ground
here, as well as some other mechanical apparatus whose purpose you do not
immediately recognize. You surmise that this series of hand-operated winches
and chains is designed to pull something heavy out of the pool. All of this
