A Claustrophobic Cavern~
   You stand within a small, dimly lit cavern. It is murky and dank in here,
and you can hear running water; though you cannot tell its source. Glowing,
half-luminescent stalactites grow on the carved, rocky ceiling. There is an
opening leading to a much larger cavern to the south, and you think you hear
glimpses of conversation coming from inside there. A large, water-beaded door
is just to the north.
