#12941
A Large Cavern~
   This room serves as the base for the Tong counterfeiting operations. It
look relatively clean, although there are heaps of stalactites growing on
the earthen ceiling. There is an immense pile of uncut metal lying next to
the strange apparatus in the middle of the room, and you wonder at its
purpose. Small stubs of still-burning waxen candles have been placed on the
floor of this circular cavern, casting strange shadows about the entire
space. The only exit lies to the north.
~
